// The enums of the Radeon RX 580's graphics block (GFX8, Polaris 10) as
// Mesa's register database has them, beside gfx8.mlx, whose fields name the
// one each takes. GENERATED by tools/gpu_registers_generate.py (do not edit:
// generate it again; README.md beside it says how) from Mesa mesa-24.0.0's
// src/amd/registers/gfx8.json, whose sha256 is
//   gfx8.json 225dcbb9c4d16cc4c79d48e1b91d19ab71afa24f6a14e3613ddc49379c08d1bb
//
// All 96 enums of the database, each a struct of its values, by the names
// the database gives them (a module of their own: some are named as the
// field that takes them). Linux's gfx_8_0_enum.h has the same values for
// every enum both have; gfx8.mlx's head names the ones only the database
// has.

